# 📚 SC-500 Complete Study Notes

This folder contains the complete companion study notes for the SC-500 Cloud and AI Security Engineer Associate learning journey.

## 📖 Main Document

**[SC-500 Complete Study Notes](./SC-500_Complete_Study_Notes.pdf)**

The document is organized around the four SC-500 security domains and includes exam-focused comparison tables, least-privilege guidance, exam traps, a final-week revision plan, and resources/labs.

## 🧭 How this repository uses the notes

- `README.md` — Master Guide / navigation layer
- `study-notes/` — Detailed theory and revision reference
- `labs/` — Hands-on implementation and engineering evidence
- `cheat-sheets/` — Quick-reference material
- `exam-preparation/` — Scenario and exam-focused preparation

> The Master Guide is the map; the Complete Study Notes are the detailed reference.
